## Done when

- [ ] Test 1 proves the one-copy rule on the seat's side. Test 2 proves the seat's library can take an id only the opponent showed. Test 3 proves an R73 card stays on the opponent's side.
- [ ] Tests 1 and 2 failed before steps 2–10 and pass after. Test 3 passes both before and after. The report says this.
